242: ## Clean Architecture Layers
243: 
244: ```typescript
245: // Architecture layers
246: ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
247: │              Presentation               │  ← CLI, API, UI
248: ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
249: │              Application                │  ← Use Cases, Commands
250: ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
251: │               Domain                    │  ← Entities, Services, Events
252: ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
253: │            Infrastructure               │  ← DB, MCP, External APIs
254: └─────────────────────────────────────────┘
255: 
256: // Dependency direction: Outside → Inside
257: // Domain layer has NO external dependencies
258: ```
